// Re-targeted, not widened. The note said this case was about not re-notifying
// a customer who has already been told — and the expectation then *allowed*
// NOTIFY_CUSTOMER and forbade RESOURCE_CARRIER instead, so it tested nothing of
// the sort. It now forbids the thing it claims to be about, which makes it
// stricter in that dimension. EXPEDITE is allowed because with no reachable
// alternative it is the only lever left, and the agent choosing it was a
// reasonable read of a case that was not asking the question it said it was.
